# Admin-uploaded product images are managed directly via GitHub API.
# They must NEVER be committed from local — the admin panel uploads
# them to GitHub directly, and local copies will always be stale.
#
# DO NOT run: git add public/images/
#
# If you accidentally do, the uploaded images on GitHub will be overwritten
# with outdated local copies and appear broken on the website.

# Ignore ALL image files in this folder from local git tracking:
*.webp
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
*.gif
*.avif

